Paying an AI agent $100 for DeFi research can return 15 pages of polished nonsense, technically complete yet worthless.

@termix_ai AACP framework fixes this by letting the buyer lock evaluation rules before the agent accepts the job.

Objective checks run in a zkVM; subjective scoring uses a TEE plus multiple LLMs; the criteria are committed onchain so they cannot change later.

